+        // Geometry alone (width/height/pixelsPerUnit/pivot) previously stood in for "this
+        // persisted asset is up to date", so a source-authoring change that only edits which
+        // colors a Tile's texture paints (e.g. the NSC-042 seamless wall brick pattern fix)
